A native Android build of VRChat is available on Steam's public branch. Steam lists an Android depot and an OpenXR APK for the build as of {{Date|2026-07-24}}.<ref name="SteamDBAndroidSteamOS2026-07">[https://steamdb.info/app/438100/history/?changeid=37514799 App history change 37514799] on ''steamdb.info''; retrieved July 25, 2026.</ref> The build is tracked as {{Version|live-android-steamos}} (build {{Version/Build|live-android-steamos}}).<ref name="SteamDBAndroidSteamOS2026-07" />

