Work has been discovered in [[VRChat SDK|World SDK]] 3.10.4, including [[Items|Props]] being able to trigger events.<ref name="SDK3104">[https://creators.vrchat.com/releases/release-3-10-4 "Release 3.10.4"] on ''creators.vrchat.com''; dated June 17, 2026; retrieved July 28, 2026.</ref>

